# VSCode Extension Package Ignore
# Strict allowlist: ignore everything by default, then include only ship assets.

# Ignore everything
**

# Include runtime bundle and required metadata
!dist/**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE.txt
!icon.png
!demo.html

# Never package build maps and artifacts
dist/**/*.map
dist/**/*.vsix
*.vsix
